			(property "Description" "Waveshare ESP32-C6-Pico (ESP32-C6-MINI-1), 40-pin castellated (20/side), Raspberry Pi Pico form factor. Pins per Waveshare wiki. TX/RX = GPIO16/GPIO17 (UART0). GPIO8/GPIO9 are strapping/BOOT pins. GPIO22/GPIO23 are used by the onboard TCA9554PWR I2C expander that provides EXIO1-7."
